进行一场激烈的战斗。\n*   **构图**：人物位于画面中央偏上，构图稳定，背景的树木和光影为人物提供了良好的衬托，使人物成为视觉焦点。\n\n### 总结\n\n这是一张极具艺术感和视觉冲击力的摄影作品，通过精妙的光影、丰富的细节和富有张力的动态姿态，成功塑造了一个超凡脱俗、威严而美丽的女战士形象。她仿佛从神话或仙侠世界中走出，带着剑与仙气，悬浮于天地之间，令人不禁想象她背后的故事与力量。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 183, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [402.9629211425781, 256.6666564941406], "pos": [2350.165771484375, -2800.9228515625], "id": 25, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [27], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 115], "pos": [2378.95166015625, -2484.48388671875], "widgets_values": [2048, 2048, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [148, 170], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [145.9736785888672, 51.51597213745117], "pos": [4885.1103515625, -1984.7528076171875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 150, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 186, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 116, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-cor